## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# BenchmarkDotNet output
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml
/.vs
/src/.vs

.mcp.json

# repowise (local cache — per docs/WORKSPACES.md in repowise repo)
.repowise/
.repowise-workspace/
.repowise-workspace.yaml

# Generated by csharp-api-outline skill
docs/OUTLINE.md
docs/OUTLINE.internal.md

# roam deploy state (sync manifests + run summaries)
.roam/

# Agent and AI tooling. All of it is local configuration for whatever assistant a
# contributor happens to use, and none of it describes this library. Ignored as a
# category rather than file by file, so a new tool's dotfile does not land in a
# commit before anyone notices it. The csharpier hook that used to live in
# .claude/ is configured outside this repo; see .csharpierrc and CONTRIBUTING.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.gsd/
.mcp.json

# Repowise codebase index. Machine-local, regenerable, and large.
.repowise/
